ments mainly affect:", "options": {"A": "Goods rates", "B": "Staff pay", "C": "Parcel handling", "D": "Fare accounting on the ticket"}, "answer": "D", "i": "qb642tkg7um"}, {"q": "Duplicate tickets issued in lieu of lost ones are:", "options": {"A": "Charged as per rules and accounted", "B": "Always free", "C": "Never issued", "D": "Goods earnings"}, "answer": "A", "i": "qwsmec68tbc"}, {"q": "Cloak room charges collected at stations are:", "options": {"A": "Goods earnings", "B": "Capital receipts", "C": "Other coaching earnings", "D": "Freight"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q1ukzo2sudsx"}, {"q": "The daily account of coaching earnings is also called the:", "options": {"A": "Balance sheet", "B": "Daily summary", "C": "Ledger", "D": "Journal"}, "answer": "B", "i": "qsimh6b0uyr"}, {"q": "The Station Master signs the daily summary to:", "options": {"A": "Decorate it", "B": "Delay submission", "C": "Avoid duty", "D": "Certify its correctness"}, "answer": "D", "i": "q21c8fgow7yo"}, {"q": "Ticket tubes issued to TTEs for excess fare collection are:", "options": {"A": "Money-value stock to be accounted", "B": "Free gifts", "C": "Scrap", "D": "Uniform items"}, "answer": "A", "i": "qs95xqjp44z"}, {"q": "Monthly season tickets sold are entered in the:", "options": {"A": "Goods register", "B": "Parcel book", "C": "Coaching ticket returns", "D": "Cash book only"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q1785bizsq8b"}, {"q": "Student concession tickets are accounted at:", "options": {"A": "Full fare", "B": "The concessional fare collected", "C": "Zero", "D": "Double fare"}, "answer": "B", "i": "qd0idnr18kp"}, {"q": "Platform ticket earnings at large stations are:", "options": {"A": "Ignored as small", "B": "Goods earnings", "C": "Capital", "D": "Accounted under coaching"}, "answer": "D", "i": "q23zftwectzq"}, {"q": "A 'nil' return from a station means:", "options": {"A": "No transactions to report", "B": "An error", "C": "A loss", "D": "A profit"}, "answer": "A", "i": "qhlp8gvxplf"}, {"q": "Station accounts are inspected by:", "options": {"A": "Passengers", "B": "Vendors", "C": "Accounts and traffic inspectors", "D": "Porters"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q29e9kxa30ln"}, {"q": "Cash collected at small wayside stations is remitted:", "options": {"A": "Never", "B": "To the cash office as prescribed", "C": "To the TTE", "D": "To the guard"}, "answer": "B", "i": "q279lnw0v6h3"}, {"q": "The main safeguard against ticket fraud is:", "options": {"A": "Trust", "B": "Speed", "C": "Luck", "D": "Serial-numbered stock accounting"}, "answer": "D", "i": "q1y6c44n7t9q"}, {"q": "An overcharge detected in fare collection is:", "options": {"A": "Refunded to the passenger and recorded", "B": "Kept quietly", "C": "Ignored", "D": "Doubled"}, "answer": "A", "i": "qt9lxh7he3u"}, {"q": "An undercharge detected later is:", "options": {"A": "Ignored", "B": "Written off silently", "C": "Recovered from the party and accounted", "D": "Doubled"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q6lyqamwyq0"}, {"q": "Coaching earnings exclude:", "options": {"A": "Passenger fares", "B": "Freight charges", "C": "Parcels", "D": "Platform tickets"}, "answer": "B", "i": "q2ba1aqzy8r1"}, {"q": "Delay in daily remittance of station cash is:", "options": {"A": "Rewarded", "B": "A bonus", "C": "Routine", "D": "Treated as an irregularity"}, "answer": "D", "i": "qie9h3g6vdk"}, {"q": "Ticket stock received from the press is checked for:", "options": {"A": "Serial numbers and quantity", "B": "Colour", "C": "Weight", "D": "Smell"}, "answer": "A", "i": "q2b34izhbvq2"}, {"q": "Spoilt tickets found at issue are:", "options": {"A": "Resold", "B": "Reused", "C": "Defaced and accounted for", "D": "Ignored"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q1arycennmux"}, {"q": "The booking office daily account is prepared:", "options": {"A": "Yearly", "B": "At the close of day", "C": "Weekly", "D": "Never"}, "answer": "B", "i": "qosj3unyguk"}, {"q": "Machine-issued UTS tickets carry:", "options": {"A": "No record", "B": "Manual entry only", "C": "Nothing", "D": "A system record of each sale"}, "answer": "D", "i": "q2a75nv76elc"}, {"q": "PRS cancellation receipts are dealt with in the:", "options": {"A": "Refund/cancellation account", "B": "Fresh sales account", "C": "Goods account", "D": "Capital account"}, "answer": "A", "i": "q22j8y5qbg0t"}, {"q": "Tatkal charges collected from passengers are:", "options": {"A": "Goods earnings", "B": "Capital", "C": "Coaching earnings", "D": "Ignored"}, "answer": "C", "i": "qnx4hhvz4xl"}, {"q": "Dynamic (premium) fare charges are part of:", "options": {"A": "Goods", "B": "Coaching", "C": "Sundry", "D": "Capital"}, "answer": "B", "i": "q1y341c3uv93"}, {"q": "Superfast surcharge collected on tickets is credited to:", "options": {"A": "Goods", "B": "Capital", "C": "Suspense", "D": "Coaching"}, "answer": "D", "i": "q214zkqty4dq"}, {"q": "Reservation fee collected at booking is:", "options": {"A": "Part of coaching earnings", "B": "Goods earnings", "C": "Capital", "D": "Never accounted"}, "answer": "A", "i": "q19cog2zm541"}, {"q": "Excess baggage (luggage) charges are:", "options": {"A": "Goods", "B": "Capital", "C": "Coaching", "D": "Freight"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q19dqp5k0fnq"}, {"q": "Military warrants exchanged for tickets are accounted as:", "options": {"A": "Ignored", "B": "Coaching earnings at warrant value", "C": "Goods", "D": "Capital"}, "answer": "B", "i": "qu21fborbnf"}, {"q": "Free passes and privilege ticket orders are:", "options": {"A": "Coaching earnings", "B": "Goods", "C": "Capital", "D": "Not earnings, but recorded separately"}, "answer": "D", "i": "qeedrn2kzbd"}, {"q": "Collections from ticket-checking drives are remitted:", "options": {"A": "With the daily station earnings", "B": "Kept by staff", "C": "Never", "D": "Yearly"}, "answer": "A", "i": "q1874c7sidsp"}, {"q": "The periodical coaching earnings return is checked against:", "options": {"A": "The weather", "B": "Staff rosters", "C": "Cash remittances and ticket returns", "D": "Train timetables"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q1dn770exw4